---
.title = "Fresh theme",
.date = .date("2013-06-18T00:00:00"),
.layout = "post.shtml",
---

I changed the blog’s theme from the default to [fresh](https://github.com/jsliang/pelican-fresh/). I wanted to have something that uses [Twitter Bootstrap](http://twitter.github.io/bootstrap/) so that if you resize the browser window, or read the posts on a small screen, the layout changes dynamically.

Also, now there’s a Github ribbon in the top right corner, and social links on the right.
